/**
 * Jurexio - Statute seed EXPANSION Vol.5 (India, enlarged)
 * NV-STATUTE-EXPANSION-005
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * PURE DATA MODULE (no DB / no side-effect imports). Further deepens the Indian
 * statute corpus with constitutional depth (articles + key Amendment Acts +
 * Tenth Schedule anti-defection), more BNS/BNSS/IPC/NDPS, NCLT/NCLAT & IBC,
 * SEBI LODR/Takeover/PIT, FEMA/GST/Income-tax depth, IP (GI / Plant Varieties),
 * ADR (Commercial Courts / Mediation 2023), and many sectoral & welfare Acts.
 *
 * Section texts are concise, accurate paraphrases suitable for RAG grounding +
 * citation, keyed by the canonical (jurisdiction, act_short_title,
 * section_number) unique tuple. Act short titles / section numbers here are
 * NEW relative to getIndiaStatutes() and Vol.1-4 (verified 0 dup keys).
 */
